hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"539","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se raat ki namaz key baarey mein poochha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do (rakatein) hai. Phir jab tum mein se koi Subah ka khauf karey to aik rakat padhey jo uskey liye jo us ne padha witr bana degi. (Bukhari: 990)"
"540","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gyaarah rakatein padhtey they. Wo Aapki namaz thi, yaani raat mein. To Aap us mein sajda itna lamba kartey jitna tum mein se koi pachaas aayatein padhey, apna sar uthaanay se pehley. Aur Fajr ki namaz se pehley do rakatein padhtey, phir apni daaen karwat par let-tey yahan tak ke Aap key paas namaz key liye moazzin aata. (Bukhari: 994)"
"541","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saari raat witr padha aur Aapka witr sehri tak khatm hua. (Bukhari: 996)"
"542","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni raat ki aakhri namaz witr banao. (Bukhari: 998)"
"543","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) oont par witr padhtey they. (Bukhari: 999)"
"544","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Subah mein qunoot padha? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To un se kaha gaya: Kya Aap ne ruku se pehley qunoot padha? Unhon-ne kaha: Ruku key baad thodi der (baad). (Bukhari: 1001)"
"545","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mahina bhar qunoot padha, Ril aur Zakwaan par baddua kartey huey. (Bukhari: 1003)"
"546","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Qunoot Maghrib aur Fajr mein tha. (Bukhari: 1004). Kitaab-ul-Istisqaa."
